  "description": "Unfortunately we will not be offering a Kepler complete in 2024!\n\nThe Kepler has been a stalwart in our lineup for 7 years now and keeps going strong in 2022. We designed the Kepler with versatility in mind, it’s a gravel grinder, super commuter, galactic tourer… ready to tackle whatever you throw at it. So if you need a bike that’s as happy on the daily commute as it is on a weekend bikepacking trip, look no further than the Kepler.\n\nThe frame is constructed from double butted 4130 chromoly steel, a functional tubing which provides the perfect balance of comfort and durability. We’ve also applied an ED coating under the paint to protect against corrosion. It is fully equipped for front and rear racks, mud guards and has three bottle mount positions if you’re loading up for a longer trip. The fork also now features triple cage mounts on the fork blades.\n\nFor 2022 it is fitted with SRAM Rival 1, a lightweight 1x groupset with an extra wide range of gears to help you up those steeper climbs. WTB i19 rims laced to Formula sealed bearing thru axle hubs make for a great looking and fast rolling wheelset, wrapped in 37c WTB Riddler tyres for optimal performance on a variety of road surfaces. Last but not least the TRP Spyre disc brakes will give you total confidence when stopping in all conditions.",
